  NotifyImageMap
  NotifyMapViewOfSection
  NotifyMemoryAlloc
  NotifyMemoryFree
  NotifyMemoryProtect
  NotifyUnmapViewOfSection
  ProcessInit
  ProcessTerm
  ResetToConsistentState
  ThreadInit
  ThreadTerm
  UpdateProcessorInformation

; MADEIRA: an iOS-host build links libarm64ecfex_ios.def instead, which repeats this list and adds the
; exports whose symbols only exist under FEX_IOS_HOST (a DEF entry for a symbol that does not exist is
; a link error). Keep the shared entries in step.
